{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infamous Death Korps of Krieg march into Rust, bringing their grim, war-forged resolve to the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This pack delivers battle-scarred war gear, inspired by one of Warhammer 40,000\u2019s most fearless regiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891560/extras/3b687778b24287254721ae7035124730.avif?t=1760102199\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and march across the island clad in their signature gas-masked Hazmat suit. Shoulder your Death Korps of Krieg Backpack, designed with the rugged practicality of Astra Militarum kit. Unleash the roar of the Death Korps of Krieg Chainsword and the thunder of the Krieg Shotgun, while the Death Korps of Krieg Storage Containers transform your base into a fortified stronghold.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The pack includes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Death Korps of Krieg Hazmat Suit</strong> \u2013 Reskin of the Hazmat Suit with the classic Krieg gas mask and trench coat look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Death Korps of Krieg Backpack</strong> \u2013 Rugged field pack for the survivalist soldier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Death Korps of Krieg Chainsword</strong> \u2013 Fire up the Chainsword - a brutal chainsaw reskin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Death Korps of Krieg Shotgun</strong> \u2013 A grimdark firearm with real stopping power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Death Korps of Krieg Storage Containers</strong> \u2013 Two Krieg-styled storage barrels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891560?t=1760102199","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891560/9eef6fbadba5ff6d28edd9ce1816cca273152242/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760102199","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891560/00ff5fc51c2a52ec2a04fbd8bcb8da9609ad1bab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760102199","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891560/00ff5fc51c2a52ec2a04fbd8bcb8da9609ad1bab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760102199","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Valve Anti-Cheat enabled","id":8},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play on Tablet","id":42}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infamous Death Korps of Krieg march into Rust, bringing their grim, war-forged resolve to the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This pack delivers battle-scarred war gear, inspired by one of Warhammer 40,000\u2019s most fearless regiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891560/extras/3b687778b24287254721ae7035124730.avif?t=1760102199\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and march across the island clad in their signature gas-masked Hazmat suit. Shoulder your Death Korps of Krieg Backpack, designed with the rugged practicality of Astra Militarum kit. Unleash the roar of the Death Korps of Krieg Chainsword and the thunder of the Krieg Shotgun, while the Death Korps of Krieg Storage Containers transform your base into a fortified stronghold.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The pack includes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Death Korps of Krieg Hazmat Suit</strong> \u2013 Reskin of the Hazmat Suit with the classic Krieg gas mask and trench coat look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Death Korps of Krieg Backpack</strong> \u2013 Rugged field pack for the survivalist soldier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Death Korps of Krieg Chainsword</strong> \u2013 Fire up the Chainsword - a brutal chainsaw reskin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Death Korps of Krieg Shotgun</strong> \u2013 A grimdark firearm with real stopping power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Death Korps of Krieg Storage Containers</strong> \u2013 Two Krieg-styled storage barrels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","developers":["Facepunch Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"252490","name":"Rust"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891560/3833382bd430c09e294d1b5a894bce46eaf12d87/header.jpg?t=1760102199","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3891560/341757062/adfe6